\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between px-8 py-6 text-left\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">Do you provide free site visits?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between px-8 py-6 text-left\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">Which locations do you serve?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between px-8 py-6 text-left\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#0B4EA2]\">What types of construction projects do you handle?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)\"><button clas